00:42:02.860 --> 00:42:07.520
I was down at this other mattress store and I saw this mattress for $14.50.

1005
00:42:07.520 --> 00:42:09.040
Would you honor that price?

1006
00:42:09.280 --> 00:42:15.060
And she's like, oh, no, you didn't see this mattress because this is exclusive to our store.

1007
00:42:15.280 --> 00:42:15.660
Mm-hmm.

1008
00:42:15.660 --> 00:42:16.740
And he's like, really?

