This is part of the scam.

1012
00:42:20.820 --> 00:42:21.220
Mm-hmm.

1013
00:42:21.900 --> 00:42:22.560
Guess what?

1014
00:42:22.780 --> 00:42:28.120
This whole storyline is based on a true story from Greg Daniels' life.

1015
00:42:28.980 --> 00:42:37.460
Greg Daniels was trying to find a mattress that he loved and he was trying to buy it again because he loved it, but he needed a new one.

1016
00:42:37.460 --> 00:42:39.960
So, he couldn't find it.

1017
00:42:40.180 --> 00:42:42.540
This is when he uncovered the truth.

1018
00:42:42.740 --> 00:42:47.100
The truth, which is that mattress stores do this.

1019
00:42:47.380 --> 00:42:54.220
They have exclusive names for the exact same mattresses so that you can't compare prices.

1020
00:42:54.220 --> 00:42:56.100
I looked it up, lady.

1021
00:42:56.520 --> 00:43:07.120
There are a gazillion, gazillion Reddit threads and websites dedicated to decoding all of the names for all these mattresses that are actually the same mattress.

1022
00:43:07.420 --> 00:43:07.940
Wow.

1023
00:43:08.120 --> 00:43:08.580
Mm-hmm.

1024
00:43:09.080 --> 00:43:09.480
Yeah.

1025
00:43:09.660 --> 00:43:17.220
