00:53:46.220 --> 00:53:50.600
They say, we're from the truth teller doing a report on consumer protection.

1275
00:53:50.980 --> 00:53:53.260
And she's like, I knew your mother wasn't sick.

1276
00:53:53.540 --> 00:53:55.880
And then basically, she's like, I'm not going to say anything.

1277
00:53:55.880 --> 00:53:56.840
You have no proof.

1278
00:53:57.000 --> 00:53:58.720
And then they point to the cameras.

1279
00:53:59.060 --> 00:53:59.400
Yes.

1280
00:53:59.780 --> 00:54:01.980
They say, actually, we do have proof.

1281
00:54:02.260 --> 00:54:03.560
Here is one camera.

1282
00:54:03.780 --> 00:54:04.520
Here is another camera.

1283
00:54:04.520 --> 00:54:07.280
And they call out the camera person's name, Mandy.

1284
00:54:07.540 --> 00:54:07.880
Mm-hmm.

1285
00:54:08.160 --> 00:54:11.760
Mandy is their real B camera operator, Mandy Whitaker.

1286
00:54:12.080 --> 00:54:12.940
I thought so.

1287
00:54:13.060 --> 00:54:16.240
I thought they were just looking right at their friend behind the camera.

1288
00:54:16.680 --> 00:54:19.400
Mandy has also done camera operating on St. Dennis Medical,

1289
00:54:19.620 --> 00:54:21.160
and it's always sunny in Philadelphia.

1290
00:54:21.620 --> 00:54:24.420
Well, Cindy sees the cameras, and she's like, whatever, fine.

1291
00:54:24.680 --> 00:54:25.680
I'll give it up.

1292
00:54:26.300 --> 00:54:30.440
And I thought Mary did such a great job in this moment as Cindy,

1293
00:54:30.560 --> 00:54:31.740
and I want you guys to hear it.

1294
00:54:32.300 --> 00:54:32.920
All right.

1295
00:54:33.060 --> 00:54:33.460
Oh, no.

1296
00:54:33.980 --> 00:54:36.640
So, I actually hate this job.

1297
00:54:36.900 --> 00:54:37.220
Oh.

1298
00:54:38.480 --> 00:54:41.720
I hate this stupid polo they make you pay for yourself.

1299
00:54:42.840 --> 00:54:46.340
I was too scared to be a geologist, and now it's too late.

1300
00:54:47.500 --> 00:54:48.980
So, get your notepads out.

1301
00:54:50.100 --> 00:54:51.220
Let's burn it all down.

